      Classification.NAMESPACED_V2  → Classification.NAMESPACED
      (drops the version suffix matching the brand-side decision)
      Classifier prefix-check tuple  ["com", "pos-v2"]
      → ["com", "loam"] for the NAMESPACED arm.
      The pre-#6 historical ORPHAN_V2 arm (com.pos-v2.<single>)
      and ORPHAN_V1 arm (com.pos.<single>) are PRESERVED verbatim
